    "learning": "In Indian NSE cash equities on a \u20b910,000 capital base, transaction costs (~0.15% round-trip) severely penalize low R-multiple captures and mid-day mean-reversion chop; profitability requires wider stop buffers to survive initial institutional liquidity sweeps, stricter volume confirmation to filter out weak breakouts, and expanded profit targets to outpace fee drag.",
